---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
import Header from '../components/Header.astro';
import Footer from '../components/Footer.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Privacy Policy | avilano.dev"
  description="Privacy and data handling policy for avilano.dev, including QA & CI Diagnostic submissions, in-house Vercel Serverless Function and Linear processing, zero advertising cookies, and data deletion requests."
>
  <Header />
  <main id="main-content" class="flex-grow py-16 md:py-24">
    <article class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6">
      <div class="mb-10 pb-8 border-b border-dark-800">
        <span class="inline-block font-mono text-xs text-brand-400 font-semibold uppercase tracking-wider mb-3">
          Legal & Data Governance
        </span>
        <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-extrabold text-white tracking-tight">
          Privacy & Data Policy
        </h1>
        <p class="mt-3 text-sm text-slate-400 font-mono">
          Last updated: November 2026
        </p>
      </div>

      <div class="space-y-8 text-slate-300 text-sm sm:text-base leading-relaxed">
        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/90">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            1. Data Collected via the QA & CI Diagnostic
          </h2>
          <p class="mb-3">
            When you complete the interactive QA & CI Pipeline Readiness Diagnostic on <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">avilano.dev</span>, we collect only the information you explicitly submit:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc pl-5 space-y-1.5 text-slate-300">
            <li><strong class="text-white">Contact details:</strong> Name, Company, and Work Email.</li>
            <li><strong class="text-white">Diagnostic responses:</strong> Your answers regarding CI runtime and flake frequency, pre-merge release gating, WCAG 2.1 AA / AI safety gates, primary friction point, engineering team scale, computed readiness score, and any optional stack notes you provide.</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="mt-3 text-slate-400 text-sm">
            This information is used solely to deliver your diagnostic scorecard and respond if you choose to book an architecture review. We never sell, rent, or trade your data to third-party brokers.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/90">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            2. In-House Form Processing (Vercel & Linear)
          </h2>
          <p>
            Diagnostic form submissions are handled directly by our in-house <strong class="text-white">Vercel Serverless Functions</strong> over encrypted HTTPS connections and logged into our private <strong class="text-white">Linear</strong> workspace for follow-up. No third-party form embeds or external form-tracking scripts are loaded on this site. If you schedule a call via Cal.com, your booking details are handled directly by Cal.com under its privacy policy.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/90">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            3. Zero Third-Party Advertising Cookies
          </h2>
          <p>
            <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">avilano.dev</span> uses zero third-party advertising cookies, retargeting pixels, or cross-site ad trackers. Aggregate page-view metrics are collected using privacy-first, cookieless analytics, and third-party embeds (such as the scheduling widget) are lazy-loaded only when scrolled into view or explicitly activated.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section class="p-6 rounded-xl border border-dark-700 bg-dark-900/90">
          <h2 class="text-lg sm:text-xl font-bold text-white mb-3">
            4. Data Access & Deletion Requests
          </h2>
          <p>
            You may request a copy, correction, or complete deletion of any information you have submitted at any time. Send an email from your work address to{' '}
            <a
              href="mailto:contact@avilano.dev?subject=Data%20Deletion%20Request"
              class="text-brand-400 underline underline-offset-4 hover:text-brand-100 focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 rounded font-medium"
            >
              contact@avilano.dev
            </a>{' '}
            with the subject line <span class="font-mono text-slate-200">Data Deletion Request</span>, and your records will be permanently removed from Linear and our inbox within 5 business days.
          </p>
        </section>
      </div>

      <div class="mt-10">
        <a
          href="/"
          class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 text-sm font-mono text-brand-400 hover:text-brand-100 transition-colors focus-visible:outline-none focus-visible:ring-2 focus-visible:ring-brand-400 rounded"
        >
          &larr; Back to Home
        </a>
      </div>
    </article>
  </main>
  <Footer />
</Layout>
